{"4665540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slay The Beat", "steam_appid": 4665540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ARCADE EXPERIENCE, REBUILT FOR YOUR LIVING ROOM.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Whether you are a keyboard warrior or a dance pad veteran, Slay the Beat delivers the authentic, premium arcade rhythm experience you’ve been waiting for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY TRACK IS A NEW WORLD</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slay the Beat, you aren't just staring at a static background. We treat every song like its own interactive music video. Every single track features a unique animated character performing in a bespoke, dynamic environment that reacts to the music. From neon-drenched cyberpunk rooftops to vibrant anime-inspired arenas, the stage transforms with every song you play, making every high score run feel truly special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic feeling with a modern twist.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect a keyboard, gamepad or even a cheap dance mat and play your way.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slay with 10 unique songs and 30 different difficulties.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play alone or get your bestie to play with you offline.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ARCADE EXPERIENCE, REBUILT FOR YOUR LIVING ROOM.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Whether you are a keyboard warrior or a dance pad veteran, Slay the Beat delivers the authentic, premium arcade rhythm experience you’ve been waiting for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY TRACK IS A NEW WORLD</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slay the Bea